	<ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id='F35' contextRef='C1'>13. COnstruction for the Risberg Line was funded through an intercompany loan program of approximately $74.8M with OPATHO Gas Trans. Respondent intends to review the capital structure yearly and, if necessary, receive an equity infusion from its parent company in order to achieve targeted proprietary ratios. </ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
